Subject: [PATCH] [M156] Add safe-path downcast for BrowserAccessibilityManager

Original change's description:
> Add safe-path downcast for BrowserAccessibilityManager
>
> Fixes security vulnerability by replacing unchecked cast of attacker-
> groomable value with checked virtual downcast from `this`.
>
> Bug: 560514888
> Change-Id: Idb3be30b8846c5c955695e6fc2d9d184c5d74931
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8795865
> Commit-Queue: Aeryn Moss <aerynm@google.com>
> Reviewed-by: David Tseng <dtseng@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1749530}

(cherry picked from commit 5ff13fcde1ebfe5c6eedfe864fca192527b75334)

